<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Mbula</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tim</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɓaria cauterǝa mala Bulǝs aban ká a ban</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">Mǝncau</para>
  <para style="im">Cautera mǝnia ka nda <char style="bk">Ɓaria Cauterǝa mala Bulǝs aban ká a ban Timoti.</char> Gilǝî Timoti, muni aɓa paɓamuru a ban Kǝrǝsti lang nda aɓa kùrban a Roma a masǝlǝata túró male, tù nǝ lú male a pǝlǝa 67 ko 68 anzǝm ɓǝl Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yì cauterǝa ka, kwarkiru na ace Timoti, kǝla muntulo mǝnana ɓimǝturo na sǝ gbasha male na ka. Kwarkiri ace ɓak ɓabumi ɓǝ̀ dum nǝ gandǝrǝu aɓa nutanni, sǝ ɓǝ̀ lidǝmba nǝ túró mana yì Bulǝs pè ace Kǝrǝsti ka. Ɓǝ̀ bwal kanigir mǝ'mǝsǝcau nì mala Cau Amsǝban andǝ Kùrcau Mǝ'e, sǝ ɓǝ̀ pak túró male kǝla mǝkànìgìr andǝ mǝhama, ɓǝ̀ kǝa ɓanggi tanni ko ɓinǝcau nǝban aɓwana ɗàng, sǝama ɓǝ̀ ɓanggi kanigir nyir. À nunkiri arǝ agir ká-mǝɓane mala masǝlǝata apwari.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aɓa mǝnia kat ka, à kasǝ ɓalǝ Timoti arǝ do andǝ tǝr pakkiagir mala ɓwa mana gilǝ mǝnia yì cauterǝa ka: paɓamuru male andǝ munyi, andǝ earcearǝu, andǝ gandǝrǝu, andǝ nutanni male aɓa kum patanni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Agir mǝnana aɓalǝi ka</para>
  <para style="io1">Mǝncau<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ɓwangsǝban andǝ Ɓakɓabum<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-2:13">1:3--2:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwarkiru andǝ nunkiru<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:5">2:14--4:5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gìr mǝnana Bulǝs nda aɓalǝi ka<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:6-18">4:6-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masǝlǝatacau<char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:19-22">4:19-22</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Makkun mala Bulǝs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Man yì cauterǝa ka, pur nǝ banam Bulǝs, mǝnana Ɓakuli nǝ nggearǝì twalam ɓǝ̀n duk mǝ'mishan mala Kǝrǝsti Yesu ka. Ɓakuli tasǝam ɓǝ̀n hamnǝ ce pàcau mala yilǝmu mǝnana sǝm ndanǝi aɓa kpapi ma'sǝm sǝnǝa Kǝrǝsti Yesu ka.<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Mǝ nda ban gilǝì Timoti munem mǝnana ǝn earkiyi ace raka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Atúró 16:1</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli Tárrû, andǝ Kǝrǝsti Yesu Mǝtala sǝm, lǝmdǝo ɓwamuru, ɓǝ̀ sǝn tǝ̀r mò, sǝ ɓǝ̀ cio wu kum dorǝpwala.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓakɓabum ace do nǝ mǝsǝcau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Du andǝ pwari ka, ǝn nggǝ ɗenyi nǝ we aɓalǝ ahiwi mem. Ən nggǝ pakki Ɓakuli yàwá, yì Ɓakuli mǝnana ǝn nggǝ kpate nǝ ɓabum mǝɓoarnsari, kǝla mǝnana akêm pàk ka. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ɓǝ̀ ǝn ɗenyi nǝ mǝrǝm mǝnana a sukki a pwari gauwa ma'sǝm ngga, nzal sǝno kǝ pakkam. Ban nǝ̀ ɓoaram kǝ̀rkǝ́r, yi mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm kum ɓamur rǝ sǝm a tarǝ sǝm ɗǝm ngga. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ən nggǝ ɗenyi nǝ paɓamuru mò mǝɓafoe a ban Mǝtalabangŋo kǝla ulang pě mala keò mǝ'mɓwamae, yì Loyis andǝ nggo Yunis, sǝ ǝn sǝlǝna nǝma a ndarǝ lidǝmba aɓa mǝno yì paɓamuru ka nǝ rǝcandǝa. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Ace mani ka ǝn nggǝ kasǝ ɓālǝo ama, ɓoro mala Bangŋo mǝnana Ɓakuli po a pwari mǝnana ǝn tsǝk abuam a muro ka, lo tsǝì aɓa túró nǝ pi mala ɓabum. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Acemǝnana Bangŋo mana Ɓakuli pa sǝm ngga, mala ɓangciu na ɗang. Bangŋo mǝnana pa sǝm ngga, mala rǝcandǝa na andǝ earcearǝu andǝ bwalɓamuru. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Ace mani ka, ce kǝsǝkya pakko arǝ banggia aɓwana cau amur Mǝtalabangŋo ɗàng. Sǝ ce kǝsǝkya pakko arǝàm gbal ɗàng, kat andǝ amani ama mǝ nda a ndàkurban ace Kǝrǝsti ka. Nǝ rǝcandǝa mǝnana Ɓakuli po ka, dum nǝ kùr rǝǔ ace nutanni atàm ace hamnǝ Cau Amsǝban. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Ɓakuli amsǝ sǝm, sǝ tunǝ sǝm ɓǝ̀ sǝm duk aɓwana male amǝ fele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">sǝ tunǝ sǝm ɓǝ̀ sǝm dukdo tàr ɓamuru aceì. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;sǝ tunǝ sǝm ɓǝ̀ sǝm duk aɓwana male.&gt;&gt;</char></note> Pa ace atúró mǝnana sǝm pak ka ɗàng, nda àkǝ̀ ce male yì kani mana pusǝ sǝm ace ka, andǝ ɓwamuru male. Pà sǝm mǝnia yì ɓwamuru ka nǝ bu Kǝrǝsti Yesu sǝ yi kwakita ɓanza.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:3">1Bit 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:5">Afi 2:5</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 2:8">8</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Sǝ ado ka, lǝmdǝna sǝmi bwāng nǝ yiu mala Kǝrǝsti Yesu, Mǝ'amsǝ sǝm, mǝnana ɓun rǝcandǝa mala lú, pǝlǝa lǝmdǝa sǝm njar mala yilǝmu mǝnana málá male pà kàm raka, aɓa Cau Amsǝban. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Sǝ Ɓakuli twalam ɓǝ̀n duk mǝ hamnǝ cau male, andǝ mǝ'mishan, andǝ mǝkànìgìr mala mǝnia yì Cau Amsǝban.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 2:7">1Tim 2:7</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Nda gìr mǝnana tsǝa sǝ ǝn nggǝ nu tanni kǝla mǝno mǝ nda aɓalǝi ka. Sǝ mim ngga, kǝsǝkya kǝ pakkam arǝ mani ɗàng, acemǝnana ǝn súrǝ́nà rǝ ɓwa mǝnana ǝn gūlì arǝì, sǝ ǝn sǝlǝna ama gìr mǝnana ǝn nyingŋǝni wi a buì ka, nǝ̀ gandǝ bwale bà pwari nyare male.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Bwal kanigir mǝɓafoe mǝnana a kanì a banam ngga, ɓǝ̀ dupo gìrkànì mǝnana a nǝ kpate ka, sǝ pè aɓa paɓamuru andǝ earcearǝu mǝnana ndakam aɓa Kǝrǝsti Yesu ka. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Tsǝk kiro arǝ cau mǝ'mǝsǝcau nì, mǝnana à po a buo, nǝ rǝcandǝa mala Bangŋo Mǝfele mǝnana do a ɓabum sǝm ngga.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Kǝla mǝnana a sǝlǝna ka, aɓwana mǝnana a bu-nzali Asiya ka, à pǝlǝna nzǝmia arǝàm kat à nyìngŋǝ̀nam. Ko nggearǝ Fijelus andǝ Hamojenis gbal ka, à nyìngŋǝ̀nam.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli lǝmdǝì Onisǝforǝs andǝ amǝ ɓala male ɓwamuru, acemǝnana kǝ yiu a banam tùtù, sǝ kǝ ɓak ɓabumam, sǝ ko kǝsǝkya pakki wi arǝàm acemǝnana mǝ nda aɓa nsolo ka ɗàng. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Yiu male a Roma ka, altam kǝ̀rkǝ́r, gandǝa yi kumam. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli lǝmdǝì wi ɓwamuru ɓǝ̀ kum earmúrú a pwari nyare yiu mala Kǝrǝsti. Sǝ we ka a sǝlǝna rǝ ulang gbasha mǝnana pam a Afisu ka.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Timoti ka mǝkpata Kǝrǝsti Yesu <optbreak /> na nǝ ɓabumi kat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Sǝ we munem, Timoti ka, dum nǝ mǝsǝkang-kangŋa aɓa ɓwamuru mǝnana sǝm ndanǝi aɓa dotarǝu ma'sǝm sǝnǝa Kǝrǝsti Yesu ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Sǝ kanigir mǝnana a oê a kunam a ɓadǝmbǝ amǝ'nakún pas ka, twali, kànî aɓwana amǝ'mǝsǝcau nì mǝnana à nǝ̀ gandǝ tasǝi aban ká a ban aɓea aɓwana gbal ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Dum nǝ gandǝrǝu aɓa tanni atàm kǝla soje mǝɓoarne mala Kǝrǝsti Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Kǝ soje pâ kàm mǝnana nǝ̀ oasǝ ɓamúrì aɓa dukiado mala aɓwana mǝnana asoje na raka ɗàng, acemǝnana kǝ earce nǝ̀ pwasǝbum ɓwa mǝnana twali a soje ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Anggo gbal, ɓwa mǝnana nda aɓalǝ amǝ kārǝki amire ka, kǝ li ɗàng, she ɓǝ̀ ɓangŋǝna mire masǝlǝna tè pepè, kpana atà nggurcau mǝnana à tsǝki amǝ mire ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Mǝrya mana pak túró mǝcandǝe ka, ɓoaro ɓǝ̀ li tadǝmba ɓǝla agirɓaban mǝno tanniki aɓalǝi ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Pak ɗenyicau amur agir mǝnana ǝn nggǝ banggo ka. Ɓakuli ka, nǝ̀ mǝngio ɓalǝ amǝnia yì agir ka kat, ace mǝnana wu bwaltea.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Koya pwari ka, dum nǝ ɗenyicau ama, Yesu Kǝrǝsti, Mǝkà Dauda ka, à loasǝi a ɓembe. Mǝnia ka nda Cau Amsǝban mana ǝn nggǝ hamnǝi ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Sǝ acemǝnana ǝn nggǝ hamnǝ mǝnia yì Cau Amsǝban ngga, mǝ ndya ǝn nggǝ tanni, à kùrram nǝ ansolo kǝla ɓwa mǝnana mǝɓealɓikea na ka. Sǝa ma cau mala Ɓakuli ka, à kùrrì ɗàng. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Ace mani ka, ǝn earǝna mǝ dum nǝ gandǝrǝu aɓa ko man, ace aɓwana mana Ɓakuli tària ka, ace mǝnana yia gbal ka ɓǝà kum amsǝban mana aɓa Kǝrǝsti Yesu ka, atārǝia andǝ gulo mǝnana pà nǝ̀ mal raka. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Mǝnia yì cau ka, cau na à nǝ̀ earnǝi, mana ama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">&lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ sǝm wu sǝnǝi ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">sǝm nǝ̀ dum nǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">yilǝmu sǝnǝi gbal.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Ɓǝ̀ sǝm twal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">gandǝrǝu aɓa tanni ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">sǝm nǝ̀ duk amurǝma atè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Ɓǝ̀ sǝm tǝmce súrǝè ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">yì gbal ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">nǝ̀ tǝmce súrǝ̀ sǝm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mat 10:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:9">Luk 12:9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Ɓǝ̀ sǝm dum nǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">mǝsǝcau raka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">yì ka, dumǝna nǝ mǝsǝcau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">acemǝnana pà nǝ̀ tǝmce</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">ɓamúrì ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝtúró mǝnana Ɓakuli earnǝi ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Wu kǝ kasǝ ɓalǝ aɓwana arǝ amǝnia yì agir ka, sǝ wu nunkiria a ɓadǝm Ɓakuli, ɓǝà ɗeki makgìr amur acau. Amǝno yì amakgìr ka, à pànǝ ɓoaro ɗang, à nǝ̀ kiɗiki aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ okia ace ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Ɓariki nǝ pa rǝcandǝa arǝ túró kàngkàng, ace mǝnana wu lǝmdǝ rǝò a ɓadǝm Ɓakuli ɓǝ̀ earnǝ we. Duk mǝtúró mǝɓoarne, mǝnana kǝsǝkya pa nǝ̀ pakki wi arǝ túrè raka, mǝtúró mǝnana kǝ mǝngi ɓá cau mǝ'mǝsǝcau nì pepè ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Tārǝto arǝ naki acauɓana andǝ amǝnana à pà nǝ̀ yinǝì Ɓakuli gulo raka, acau ɓanggea mǝnana à kǝ tasǝta aɓwana nǝ tasǝa aɓa ɗwanyi súrǝ̀ Ɓakuli ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Akanìgìr ulang mǝno ka à kǝ akiban kǝla barya mpenye-gula mǝnana kǝ li ɓa'nyam ɓwa ka. Aburana ɓari mǝnana à yì kania aɓwana ulang amǝno yì akanìgìr ka, à nda ka, Hemǝniyos andǝ Filetus. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />À ɗekini njar mala mǝsǝcau, à kǝ na ama loapi ɓembe mala alú kutina. Nǝ ulang mǝnia yì kanigir ka, à tsǝ̀ngŋǝ̀nà aɓwana pas à ɗekina paɓamuru malea a ban Ɓakuli. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Kat andǝ amani ka, mǝsǝcau mala Ɓakuli ka, camǝna kàngkàng kǝla kusǝɓa mǝnana à kwaki sǝ pà nǝ̀ dǝurǝ raka. Amurí ka à nyoulǝ mǝnia yì cau ka ama: &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo súrǝ́nà rǝ aɓwana mǝnana à nda ka male ka,&gt;&gt; sǝ &lt;&lt;Koya ɓwa mǝnana kat kǝ na ama mala Mǝtalabangŋo na ka, dumǝna púp nǝ̀ gapita rǝia andǝ ɓealɓikea.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Aɓa ɓala mǝgule ka, agirtúró ndakam ɗàngɗáng; aɓea ka, à pea nǝ bolo-njengǝlan andǝ bolo-azǝrfa, sǝ aɓea ka, à pea nǝ nggun andǝ dǝɓang. Amǝnana boalea gul ka, à nda ace pwari lamsan mǝɓoarne, sǝ amana boalea gul raka, à nda ace túró ɓala mala koya pwari ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa lak ɓamúrì aɓalǝ amǝno yì aɓealu mǝɓane, do aɓa ɓoarnsari ka, nǝ̀ duk girtúró ace túró mǝgule, mǝnana à tàrni ndanǝ ɓoaro a ban mǝtala-ɓala, sǝ à gilǝkini ace koya túró mǝɓoarne ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Ɓanggi koya suno mala lo-ɓwa, sǝ wu ɓangŋa atà ɓealɓoarna, andǝ paɓamuru, andǝ earcearǝu, andǝ do rǝpwala, atarǝ wun wunǝ aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ pak hiwi a ban Mǝtalabangŋo nǝ ɓabum mǝɓoarnsari ka. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Kǝa kánǝ ɓamur rǝo aɓalǝ agǝmi makgìr andǝ amana sǝlǝe pà aɓalǝia raka ɗàng, acemǝnana we ka a sǝlǝna ama, mǝno ka kǝ yinǝ munǝo. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Sǝ guro mala Ɓakuli ka, ɓoaro ɓǝ̀ kúni ɓua aban loàsǝ̀ban andǝ kǝɓwa ɗàng. Ɓoaro ɓǝ̀ duk ɓukɓuk nǝ aɓwana kat. Ɓǝ̀ duk mǝ'sǝlǝ kanigir andǝ ɓwa nǝ munyi. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Aɓa pê ɓukɓuk ka, kwarkir aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ ɓinǝ earnǝ mǝsǝcau ka. Yakǝla ka, Ɓakuli nǝ̀ nggaɗi ɓabumia, sǝ à nǝ̀ vwaki buia arǝ cauɓikea à nǝ̀ pwanzali, ɓǝ̀ kyan nǝia aɓa súrǝ̀ mǝsǝcau. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Aɓa mǝno anggo ka, à nǝ̀ nyare aɓa ɗenyicau malea, à nǝ̀ purî ɓá gbǝ́lî mala Shetan mǝnana bwalia guro, sǝ cia à kǝ kpata cau male ka.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Ɓike mala ado a masǝlǝata apwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />We ka, sǝlǝ ama, kwano mala ado nǝ̀ nggá yiu a masǝlǝata apwari. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Ɓwapǝndǝa nǝ̀ duk amǝ earce ɓamuria, amǝ rufi atà boalo, amǝ nggori andǝ amǝ twàlɓamúrû. À nǝ̀ duk amǝ ɓǝsǝki Ɓakuli, andǝ amǝ mgbikiru a ban atárrià andǝ anggea, andǝ amǝ ɗwanyi pak yàwá, à pà nǝ̀ fali nǝ Ɓakuli ɗang. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Ɓwapǝndǝa nǝ̀ dum nǝ ɗwanyi earcearǝu, à nǝ̀ duk amǝ ɗwanyi twalbani, amǝ twalki alullǝ aɓwana, amǝ ɗwanyi bwalrǝu, amǝ bum tǝra, à pà nǝ̀ earce gìr mǝɓoarne ɗàng. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Ɓwapǝndǝa nǝ̀ duk amǝ mak aɓea, amǝ ɗwanyi tsǝkiru, amǝ gusǝlǝ-múrû, andǝ amǝ earce banɓoarnado amur earce Ɓakuli. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />À nǝ̀ lǝmdǝí a nza kǝla yià ka aɓwana mala Ɓakuli na, sǝ à ɓinǝ pà ɓamuria arǝ rǝcandǝa mala Ɓakuli mǝnana nǝ̀ cia à nǝ̀ duk do mala amǝkwaɗi ka. A ulang amǝnia yì aɓwana ka, wu ɓanggi bania.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />À nda ka aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ swár zàng, à kǝ kutiki arǝ aɓala mala aɓwana, à kǝ swár amamǝna amǝ'ɗwanyi sǝlǝe, mǝnana cauɓikea akina ɓabumia, sǝ à kǝ ɓangŋa atà koya ulang suno mǝɓane ka. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />A ulang amamǝna mǝno ka, à kǝ kyale atà akanìgìr ɗàngɗáng koya pwari, sǝ ko à kǝ gandǝ bwalta mǝsǝcau ɗàng. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Kǝla mǝnana Janis andǝ Jambǝris ɓinǝì Musa à earnǝi raka, anggo sǝ aman yì aɓwana ka, à ginǝki mǝsǝcau. Yia ka, aɓwana na mǝnana ɓabumia sharna aɓa cauɓikea, sǝ paɓamuru malea ka, mǝɓafoe na ɗang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Pur 7:11</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Sǝa ama yia ka, à pà nǝ̀ ká ɗār ɗang; ɗwanyi sǝlǝe malea nǝ̀ lǝmdǝ rǝì a ban aɓwana kat, kǝla mǝnana kum a Janis andǝ Jambǝris ka.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masǝlǝata kwarkiru mala <optbreak /> Bulǝs a ban Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Sǝ we Timoti ka, a súrǝ́nà rǝ kanigir mem andǝ ɓealam. A súrǝ́nà rǝ kanì mala ɓabumam aɓa do mem. A súrǝ̀ paɓamuru mem, andǝ munyi, andǝ earcearǝu, andǝ gandǝrǝu mem; <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />kat andǝ atanni mem, andǝ apatanni mana à yiu amuram ngga. A súrǝ́nà rǝ kanggǝrang tanni mǝnana à pam a Antiyok, andǝ Ikoniya andǝ Listǝra ka. Kat andǝ amani ka, Mǝtalabangŋo amsǝam aɓalǝ amǝnia yì agir ka kat.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:14-52">Atúró 13:14-52</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:1-20">14:1-20</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />E, sǝ koya ɓwa na ear ama nǝ̀ duk do ɓealɓoarna aɓa Kǝrǝsti Yesu ka, à nǝ̀ pè wi tanni. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Sǝ amǝ'ɓealɓikea andǝ amǝ'swarkiban ngga, à nǝ̀ lidǝmba nǝ ɓealɓikea aban ká kìɗìkì, à nǝ̀ nggǝ swarki aɓwana sǝ yià gbal ka à nǝ̀ nggǝ swarkia. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Sǝ we ka, lidǝmba aɓa mǝsǝcau mǝnana à kàniô, sǝ a earnǝi ka, acemǝnana a súrǝ́nà rǝ aɓwana mǝnana à kàniô gìr ka. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Sǝ ɓǝ̀ ɓālǝo kasǝ ama, lo mô a muntulo ka, a súrǝ̀ a Malǝmce mǝfele mana à gandǝ po sǝlǝe ace kum àwá nǝ paɓamuru a ban Kǝrǝsti Yesu ka. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Malǝmce mǝfele kat ka, ǝn'yali mala Ɓakuli na, sǝ ndanǝ ɓoaro ace kànì mǝsǝcau, andǝ lǝmdǝ ɓwarkio, andǝ gilǝkiban aɓa ɓwarkio, andǝ kwarkiru ace pàk mǝɓoarne. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Ɓakuli kǝ pangŋǝ̀nà túró nǝi, ace gilǝki aɓwana male, ɓǝà dum nǝ kùr rǝǔ ace pàk koya gìr mǝɓoarne.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="s">À kwarkir Timoti ɓǝ̀ tamsǝ kusǝì <optbreak /> ace lidǝmba mala túró <optbreak /> mala Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Ən nggǝ nunkiro a ɓadǝm Ɓakuli andǝ Kǝrǝsti Yesu, mǝnana nǝ̀ yia ɓashì aɓwana mǝnana à ndanǝ yilǝmu andǝ amǝnana à wuna ka, a pwari yiu male mǝnana nǝ̀ yiu a dumsǝ domurǝm male ka. <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />We ka, hamnǝ cau mala Ɓakuli. Do aɓa gilǝrǝu ace mǝnia yì túró ka, ko njar nda kam ko pà kàm ɗàng. Lǝmdǝì aɓwana ɓwarkio malea, nunkiria, sǝ wu ɓak ɓabumia nǝ munyi mǝgule andǝ kwarkiru ɓukɓuk. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Acemǝnana pwari nda kǝ yiu ka, mǝnana ɓwapǝndǝa pa nǝ̀ earnǝ kanigir mǝɓoarne raka. A kun mani ka, à nǝ̀ ramba amǝkànìgìr a rǝia, mǝnana à nǝ̀ pwasǝbumia nǝ nea wia gìr mǝnana kiria kǝ oākia arǝì, sǝ à earkiyi ce oe ka. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />À nǝ̀ ɓinǝ mǝsǝcau, à pànǝ earce oe ɗang, à nǝ̀ o atà njarnzǝne. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Sǝ we ka, hami rǝo aɓa koya ulang ɓealu mala do, dumnǝ gandǝrǝu aɓa nutanni, pak túró mala Mǝhama, lùmsǝ túró mǝnana a pakkiyi ace Ɓakuli ka. <verse eid="2TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Ma mem ngga, pwari kārǝ́na ɓǝ̀ ǝn pa yilǝmem kǝla ɓoro mǝnana a pè Ɓakuli ka. Pwari nying ɓanza mem kārǝ́na. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Ən munǝna munǝo mǝɓoarne, mire mem bwalǝna masǝlǝate, sǝ ǝn camǝna kàngkàng aɓa paɓamuru arǝ Kǝrǝsti māna à pam a buam ngga. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Sǝ ado ka, tangnakusǝam, yì jeko mala túró-cauɓoarna ka, nda rǝ kundǝam, mǝnana Mǝtalabangŋo, Mǝɓashi aɓa mǝsǝcau nǝ̀ pam a Pwari nyare male ka. Sǝ tangnakusǝu man ngga pa acem nǝmurǝam ɗàng, nda gbal acea aɓwana mǝnana kat à kǝ earce yiu male ka.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masǝlǝata cau mala Bulǝs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Timoti, ɓariki, yiu a banam a kaurǝa. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Acemǝnana Dimas ɗeki nam, ace earce mǝnia yì ɓanza ka, umǝna a Tasalonika. Sǝ Kǝrǝsen ngga, umǝna a Galati, sǝ mala Titus ka, umǝna a Dalmatiya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10-11</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:10-14">Kol 4:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film 24</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8:23">2Kor 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:3">Gal 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:4">Tit 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Atúró 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Kǝ Luka, nda mǝnana a banam ngga. Ɓǝ̀ a nǝ yiu ka, wu yiu wunǝ Markus, acemǝnana nǝ̀ yia bwalàm nggàm arǝ túró mem. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Tikikus ka, ǝn turni a Afisu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Atúró 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Afi 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7">Kol 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Ɓǝ̀ a nǝ yiu ka, yinǝàm nǝ nggea-daura mǝnana ǝn nyi a Tǝros, a ɓala mala Karpus ka. Sǝ wu yinǝàm nǝ amalǝmce mem, andǝ anggu mǝnana à nǝ̀ gilǝ gir aɓalǝia ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 20:6">Atúró 20:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alizanda mǝ'ntùl, pakkam gìr mǝɓike<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pakkam gìr mǝɓike: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;kìɗikiàm agir&gt;&gt;</char></note> kǝ̀rkǝ́r. Ɓakuli nǝ̀ ɓashi wi ace agir mǝnana pàk ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:20">1Tim 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Ang 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />We gbal ka, tsǝk kiro arǝì, acemǝnana kǝ munǝ arǝ koya cau sǝm bang ngga.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Tita ká mem a ɓadǝm mǝ'ɓashi ka, kǝɓwa cam a nzǝmam ɗàng. Aɓwana mesǝe, à nyem nǝmurǝam. Ɓakuli ɓǝ̀ twalia wia banì, ɓǝ̀ kǝa ɓashia wia ɗàng. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Sǝama Mǝtalabangŋo nda atàm sǝ pam rǝcandǝa ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ ǝn hamnǝ Cau Amsǝban kat ace aɓwana mana amǝ Yahudi na raka ɓǝà oè. Nyar ɗǝm ngga, amsǝam a bu lú, a kún a'im mǝnana ɓǝ́ à nǝ̀ túrǎm aɓalǝia ka. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Yì, Mǝtalabangŋo ka, nǝ̀ amsǝam aɓalǝ aɓealɓikea kat, sǝ nǝ̀ kánǝ mim jam aɓa domurǝm male mala kùli. Gulo ka, male na kat, masǝlǝate pà kàm ɗàng. Ɓǝ̀ do anggo.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masǝlǝata makkun mala Bulǝs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Makkia Pǝrisǝla andǝ Akila kûn, andǝ amǝɓala mala Onisǝforǝs.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Atúró 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:16">2Tim 1:16</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 1:17">17</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Arasǝtus ka, nda più a Korinti, sǝ Tǝrofimus ka, ǝn nyi nǝ rǝkwana a Miletus.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 19:22">Atúró 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Atúró 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:29">21:29</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2TI 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Ɓariki, yiu sǝ ɓǝ̀ kunɗwal sulǝo. Yubulǝs kǝ makko kûn, sǝ anggo gbal Pudem, andǝ Linos, andǝ Kǝlaudiya, andǝ acilia amǝ'eamrǝarǝu kat.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Ɓǝ̀ Mǝtalabangŋo do atà bangŋo mò. Ɓǝ̀ ɓwamuru male do atà wun kat.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>